## Lecture — Signed URL à courte expiration

```typescript
async getSignedReadUrl(photoId: string, user: AuthUser): Promise<string> {
  const photo = await this.prisma.photo.findUnique({
    where: { id: photoId },
    include: { mission: true },
  })
  if (!photo) throw new NotFoundException()

  await this.assertCanViewPhoto(photo, user)   // RBAC + ownership

  return cloudinary.url(photo.cloudinaryPublicId, {
    type: 'private',
    sign_url: true,
    secure: true,
    expires_at: Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000) + 300,   // 5 min
  })
}
```

**Règle dure** : pas d'URL publique permanente. Toujours signées, expiration ≤ 5 min.

