## RGPD — Rétention 12 mois

### Suppression automatique des photos

Cron quotidien :

```typescript
@Cron('0 3 * * *')   // 3 h du matin
async purgeOldPhotos() {
  const cutoff = subMonths(new Date(), 12)

  const photos = await this.prisma.photo.findMany({
    where: {
      mission: { completedAt: { lt: cutoff } },
      deletedAt: null,
    },
    take: 500,
  })

  for (const photo of photos) {
    await cloudinary.uploader.destroy(photo.cloudinaryPublicId, { type: 'private' })
    await this.prisma.photo.update({
      where: { id: photo.id },
      data: { deletedAt: new Date(), cloudinaryPublicId: '__deleted__' },
    })
  }

  this.logger.info({ count: photos.length }, 'Photos purged (RGPD retention)')
}
```

**On garde** la ligne en DB (pour l'historique de mission), on supprime juste le blob Cloudinary.

